From 7162620c0b3599dd5f0b695ae649c16d86c21ad3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:16:03 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Wi-Fi window, tray pictures with tooltips, /proc/dswifi
 network list

- nds driver: /proc/dswifi scans, fetches the ARM7's AP list, invalidates the
  cache over it and prints "bssid channel open|wep signal name" per network;
  nds_get_scan invalidates the list too.
- dsnet.c (linked into dssettings, "dssettings wifi"): Wi-Fi on/off, scan
  (turns Wi-Fi on), list with signal/WEP/saved/online, connect with WEP key
  entry, saved networks in /home/wifi.known, forget.
- dsdesk: tray shows Wi-Fi, battery and volume as pictures only, with a
  tooltip on hover or tap; a tap on the Wi-Fi bars opens the Wi-Fi window.
  Network menu: Wi-Fi, Wi-Fi status, SSH server.
- wifi-scan prints /proc/dswifi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
